{{Quote|Power generators? That's what you're smuggling? These are pretty hard to get these days, old man. Expensive, too.|[[Ezra Bridger]], to [[Hondo Ohnaka]]|<ref name="Brothers of the Broken Horn" />}}
'''Power generators''' were devices capable of generating power.<ref name="TEOH" /> Some power generators, such as the [[Class-4T3 power generator]] and the [[Class-5B1 duplex power generator]], were manufactured by [[Eksoan]].<ref name="Survival">''[[Rey's Survival Guide]]''</ref> Some generators were capable of generating enough energy to power an entire colony.<ref name="TEOH" /> Other models were far smaller and used to power vehicles, such as the [[Moll K-19 power generator]] that powered [[Joben T-85 speeder bike]]s.<ref name="RVG">''[[Star Wars Rebels: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> The generators were easy to detect with [[Sensor|scanners]] while active.<ref name="TEOH" /> [[Power droid]]s, which acted as ambulatory batteries, were equipped with a small, internal power generator.<ref name="Character Encyclopedia">''[[Star Wars Character Encyclopedia: Updated and Expanded]]''</ref>

